0036:     - The foreground consists of exactly two 4-connected monochrome hollow rectangular frames.
0037:     - Each frame is one cell thick and has a background-colored interior.
0038: 
0039:     Rule
0040:     - Measure each frame by the area strictly inside its border.
0041:     - Select the unique frame with the largest interior area.
0042:     - Return a 2x2 grid filled with that frame's color.
0043: 
0044:     Key insight
