> - 操作类：裁剪(crop), 镜像(mirror), 平移(translate), 对齐(align), 透明叠加(transparent_overlay), 扩展(expand), 边框绘制(frame_drawing), 对接(dock), 射线延伸(ray_cast/ray_extension), 填充(fill), 重涂色(recolor), 外推(extrapolate), 印章覆盖(stamp_repeat), 计数(counting), 逻辑运算(logical_op), 比较(compare), 吸附(snap), 擦除(erase), 图案复制(pattern_replication), 旋转(rotation), 拼图组装(jigsaw_assemble), 对称补全(symmetric_complete), 洪泛填充(flood_fill), 排序(sorting), 平铺(tile), 拼接(concatenate), 筛选(filter), 压缩(compress)
> - 对象类：矩形框(rect_frame), 图案块(motif), 标记像素(marker_pixel), 精灵体(sprite), 引导标记(guide_marker), 分隔行(separator_row), 前景掩码(foreground_mask), 单像素标记(single_pixel_marker), 横带(horizontal_band), 内部槽位(interior_socket), 可移动组件(movable_component), 结构体(structure), 同心方环(concentric_ring), 等距标记点(equally_spaced_markers), 算术线(arithmetic_line), 中心像素(center_pixel), 实心矩形(solid_rectangle), 前景对象(foreground_object), 二值掩模(binary_mask), 分隔条(separator_bar), 空心矩形(hollow_rectangle), 封闭区域(enclosed_region), 孤立像素(singleton_pixel), 锚块(anchor_block), 外框边缘(outer_frame), 空心框(hollow_frame), 角落标记(corner_marker), 碎片(fragment), 墙壁线段(wall_segment), 画布边界(canvas_boundary), 表格单元(table_cell), 网格分隔线(grid_separator), 前景图案(foreground_motif), 填充矩形(filled_rectangle), 颜色网格(color_grid), 空心方框(hollow_square), 连接线(connector_line), 内部遮罩(interior_mask)
> - 空间关系类：颜色匹配(color_match), 锚点对齐(anchor_aligned), 逐格对齐(cell_aligned), 按行排序(sorted_by_row), 射线方向推断(ray_inferred_direction), 距离映射(distance_mapping), 等距共线(equally_spaced_collinear), 逐像素对应(pixelwise_correspond), 面积比较(area_comparison), 最近距离(nearest_distance), 源角到目标角映射(source_to_target_mapping), 镜像对称(mirror_symmetry), 区域封闭(region_enclosure), 频率统计(frequency_statistic), 对角线偏移复制(diagonal_offset_copy), 环形连接(ring_connection), 包围盒行列分组(bbox_row_column_grouping)
> - 条件/判断类：边色不符则翻转(mismatch_flip), 跨面板搬运(cross_panel_move), 并集合并(union_merge), 中点划分归属(midpoint_band_assignment), 轨迹涂黑(trail_painted_black), 切比雪夫距离(chebyshev_distance), 中心对齐(center_aligned), 边界内延续(continue_within_bounds), 重叠停止(overlap_stop), 像素数映射颜色(count_to_color), 逻辑或非合并(logical_NOR_combine), 最大内部面积胜出(largest_interior_wins), 输出纯色小块(output_solid_block), 最短距离分配(nearest_frame_assign), 冲突优先级(conflict_priority), 各角独立着色(per_corner_coloring), 同色不相邻(same_color_no_touch), 翻转裁剪区域(flip_cropped), 最小尺寸过滤(minimum_size_filtering), 忽略干扰项(ignore_distractors), 孤立背景区域填充(unreachable_background_filled), 按计数升序(ascending_by_count), 画布加倍(canvas_doubling), 顺时针轮换(clockwise_rotation)
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

